    "text": "function Absval (X : Integer) return Integer;\n\nfunction Absval (X : Integer) return Integer is\n   Result : Integer := X;\nbegin\n   if X >= 0 then\n      if X = 0 then\n         Result := 0;\n      end if;\n   else\n      Result := -X;\n   end if;\n   return Result;\nend Absval;\n",
